* Ideas

- an `[anchor]` can be a form of /link value/ in Norg.
  so I can /auto-import/ the link and just use `[this]` syntax all over the document.
  This will be the implementation of obsidian style wiki-link in Norg.
- `category.template.norg` file to automatically create category page from given category name.

** Macro ideas

- import git information as document meta (e.g. `created` and `updated` fields)
- show git history of that current note in HTML

